      "summary": "<p>The SEL-751A offers industrial and utility feeder protection with flexible I/O options, easy retrofit, and fast setup and configuration. The SEL-751A provides complete feeder protection with overcurrent, voltage, and frequency elements. The SEL-751A remediates arc-flash hazards with arc-flash detection.</p>",
